771-25/473392005_1141123480550511_7944056824242099643_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ghdX6jL1YXMQ7kNvwEl9bJy&_nc_oc=AdoioPCrJe-QSIjr8lHQIx6J_87oDoQ0vUyZsiErGAkC3_dlddF063Y4n7LZRzAtFbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQU970IYqqCHfbvTdU1Tr0e0WxXpEpTN2ITduvZ1ntIYg&oe=6AEC8821"}, "display_name": "Calculator two memory cells", "keywords": ["calculator", "calculate", "memory", "accountant", "numbers"], "long_description": "Dual Memory Cells: Store and recall two separate values for enhanced calculation flexibility.\n\nIntuitive UI: Simple and user-friendly interface designed for efficient calculations.\n\nBasic Arithmetic Operations: Perform addition, subtraction, multiplication, division and percent with ease.\n\nMemory Management: Save, clear, and swap between two memory slots effortlessly.\n\nMeta Quest 3 Compatibility: Optimized for VR usage to enhance the calculation experience.\n\nThe calculator supports up to 15 decimal places for precision in the standard version.\n\nMaximum supported digits per calculation: 32.\n\nSome operations may result in minor floating-point inaccuracies due to inherent computation limitations.\n\nExponential notation is supported up to 1e\u00b1308.\n\nLarge calculations may introduce rounding errors due to floating-point arithmetic constraints.\n\nPro Version: Will offer higher precision with up to 34 decimal places and increased computation accuracy for complex calculations.", "short_description": "Dual Memory Cells: Store and recall two separate values for enhanced calculation flexibility.\n\nBasic Arithmetic Operations: Perform addition, subtraction, multiplication, division and percent with ease.\n\nMemory Management: Save, clear, and swap between two memory slots effortlessly."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xr-meta.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Individual Entrepreneur Sergii Kulish", "support_websi